{"v":4,"desc":"Foxy's Coin Hunt 是一款激動人心的平台遊戲，玩家扮演 Foxy 的角色，這是一隻可愛的狐狸，它穿梭於不同的世界以收集盡可能多的硬幣。 一路上，福克西必須面對形形色色的敵人。 玩家還可以使用各種物品來幫助他們對抗敵人和解決問題。 Foxy 的 Coin Hunt 提供設計精美的世界，將取悅所有年齡段的玩家。 你會接受挑戰並幫助 Foxy 實現他的最終目標嗎？\n\n特徵：\n\n動態平台遊戲\n挑戰各種敵人\n探索不同的世界並收集硬幣","publisher":"Gametry","release":"2023-02-02","genres":["街機","冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9a30f1cd382146d3193575cfacd9f255822ba36573ddb7b9acbd084c34e71acc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9720f8f7860db94f86368c41477252bf6d6d884091c7193d8193ccf721cc285c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d4c3413d50e62fe468da168a996f6d239855ed1c626204af7f03cc67d103157a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f58837db4d7e10f1f472b4497a8d6be2d076d685e47f0789d27bcd5bab34e99f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6c82a238843326effca8c33743484d4d0822c1aabb134da70377c087fd8c91fc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9f221452dc25d08d061b053ac23711e344f082f658223b187ce84e7cc61dae96.jpg"],"titleId":"0100ee401a378000","dlc":[]}